# Repo-root ignores. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
#
# Everything below mma-saas/ is covered by mma-saas/.gitignore. This file
# exists because `git add -A` run from anywhere stages the WHOLE repo — the
# git root is C:\dev\kombatdesk, not mma-saas — and on 2026-09-14 that swept
# "Claude outputs/handoff-2026-09-11-prod-config.md" into a public commit.

# Session handoff docs. Same reasoning as mma-saas/.gitignore's block on
# docs/product-overview.md: these enumerate unbuilt stages, unfixed defects,
# deploy failure modes, Stripe account ids and webhook endpoint ids. That is
# a map of the product's gaps and is worth more to a competitor than any
# credential in the tree. The canonical copies live in the claude.ai project.
Claude outputs/

# Query dumps and scratch text files. members.txt was ~39KB of real member
# names and phone numbers.
*.txt
